-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §34 (part ט, התאמות של תנאים פיזיים בבתי
-- הספר): the employers adapt the schools' physical conditions to the needs
-- the reform brings — work corners for the teachers, built and equipped,
-- for one — within the budget the Ministry of Education transfers.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `34 התאמות של תנאים פיזיים בבתי הספר`

DECLARE `Oz section 34 action` IS ONE OF
    `adapt the school's physical conditions to the needs the reform brings`

-- ¶1: the adaptations the needs of the reform call for, "כגון" building
-- work corners for the teachers and equipping them: the example opens the
-- list rather than closing it (convention reading.closed-list).
@ref akn:art_34/p1
DECLARE `adaptation of a school's physical conditions` IS ONE OF
    `building work corners for the teachers`
    `equipping the teachers' work corners`
    `another adaptation the reform's needs call for`

GIVEN a IS AN `adaptation of a school's physical conditions`
      `the reform's needs call for it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an adaptation section 34 speaks of` a `the reform's needs call for it` IF
    `the reform's needs call for it`

-- ¶1: the employers carry the adaptations out "בהתאם לתקציב שיעביר משרד
-- החינוך": as far as the budget the Ministry transfers reaches, and no
-- further. The text sets no day (convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_34/p1
GIVEN `the cost of the adaptation` IS A NUMBER
      `the budget the Ministry transferred, unspent` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the budget the Ministry transferred` `the cost of the adaptation` `the budget the Ministry transferred, unspent` IF
    `the cost of the adaptation` AT MOST `the budget the Ministry transferred, unspent`

GIVEN a IS AN `adaptation of a school's physical conditions`
      `the reform's needs call for it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the cost of the adaptation` IS A NUMBER
      `the budget the Ministry transferred, unspent` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz section 34 action`
DECIDE `adapting the school's physical conditions` a `the reform's needs call for it` `the cost of the adaptation` `the budget the Ministry transferred, unspent` IS
    IF      `an adaptation section 34 speaks of` a `the reform's needs call for it`
        AND `within the budget the Ministry transferred` `the cost of the adaptation` `the budget the Ministry transferred, unspent`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `adapt the school's physical conditions to the needs the reform brings`
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `34 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `an adaptation section 34 speaks of` `building work corners for the teachers` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `an adaptation section 34 speaks of` `another adaptation the reform's needs call for` FALSE
#ASSERT `within the budget the Ministry transferred` 50000 50000 AND NOT `within the budget the Ministry transferred` 50001 50000
#ASSERT `adapting the school's physical conditions` `building work corners for the teachers` TRUE 60000 50000 EQUALS FULFILLED
